  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Swecare f&#xf6;r insatser inom h&#xe4;lsomr&#xe5;det i Ukraina 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Swecare for health sector project in Ukraine 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Ukraine in the health care sector with a focus on the private sector&#x2019;s role in contributing to Ukraine&#x2019;s reconstruction and EU integration. The contribution is made up of a study accounting for the needs in Ukraine in the health care sector as well as of support to initiatives to address those needs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdrag till Swecare om att utarbeta en f&#xf6;rstudie kring Ukrainas behov inom h&#xe4;lso- och sjukv&#xe5;rdssektorn samt att st&#xf6;dja insatser som fr&#xe4;mjar n&#xe4;ringslivets bidrag till Ukrainas uppbyggnad och EU-n&#xe4;rmande inom h&#xe4;lso- och sjukv&#xe5;rdssektorn.</narrative>
  </description>
